  "content": "# Dimension Fixer\n\nDimension Fixer 主要用于修复自定义维度的硬编码行为。\n\n## 功能特性\n\n- 修复进度 advancement 和配方解锁问题。\n- 修复末影龙战斗未开始以及退出传送门未创建的问题 (<= [MC 1.21.11])。\n- 修复末地折跃门无法使用。\n- 修复客户端末地音乐不播放。\n- 修复数据包维度位置谓词检查。\n- 修复传送门搜索半径 (>=0.0.6)。\n- 修复睡眠功能 (>=0.0.6 + <=[MC 1.21.11])。\n- 覆盖平坦检查 (>=0.0.9)。\n- 支持简单的配置和数据包。\n\n**可以添加到现有的模组包或世界中，也可以轻松从现有世界中移除。请务必先备份您的世界。**\n\n欢迎在 [GitHub Discussion](https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/discussions) 或 [Discord](https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz) 上为原版或模组维度的新功能提出建议。\n\n## 使用方法\n\n您可以通过配置文件或使用数据包以数据驱动的方式配置此模组。\n\n<details>\n<summary>配置文件 (dimensionfixer.json)</summary>\n\n```\n{\n    \"aliases\": {\n        \"minecraft:overworld\": {\n            \"dimension_types\": [\n                \"minecraft:overworld\",\n                \"minecraft:overworld_caves\",\n                \"customdimensiontype:overworld_mirror\"\n            ],\n            \"dimensions\": [\n                \"customdimension:overworld_mirror\"\n            ]\n        },\n        \"minecraft:the_nether\": {\n            \"dimension_types\": [\n                \"minecraft:the_nether\",\n                \"customdimensiontype:the_nether_mirror\"\n            ],\n            \"dimensions\": [\n                \"customdimension:the_nether_mirror\"\n            ]\n        },\n        \"minecraft:the_end\": {\n            \"dimension_types\": [\n                \"minecraft:the_end\",\n                \"customdimensiontype:the_end_mirror\"\n            ],\n            \"dimensions\": [\n                \"customdimension:the_end_mirror\"\n            ]\n        },\n        \"customdimension:dimension\": {\n            \"dimension_types\": [\n                \"customdimensiontype:dimension_mirror\"\n            ],\n            \"dimensions\": [\n                \"customdimension:dimension_mirror\"\n            ]\n        }\n    },\n    \"tweaks\": {\n        \"customdimension:dimension\": {\n            \"fix_sleeping\": true,\n            \"fix_portal_search_radius\": true,\n            \"override_flat_check\": true\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>数据包</summary>\n\n### 别名 (Aliases)\n\n在您数据包命名空间文件夹（通常是 minecraft）中，创建一个名为 \"dimensionfixer\" 的文件夹，并在其中创建 \"alias\" 文件夹。在 alias 文件夹中，创建一个以您的维度名称命名的 json 文件，内容如下：\n\n```\n{\n    \"dimension_types\": [\n        \"test:one\"\n    ],\n    \"dimensions\": []\n}\n```\n-> data\\\\{namespace}\\dimensionfixer\\alias\\\\{dimension}.json\n\n### 调整项 (Tweaks)\n\n在您数据包的命名空间文件夹中，创建一个名为 \"dimensionfixer\" 的文件夹，并在其中创建 \"tweak\" 文件夹。在 tweak 文件夹中，创建一个以您的维度名称命名的 json 文件，内容如下：\n\n```\n{\n    \"fix_sleeping\": true,\n    \"fix_portal_search_radius\": true,\n    \"override_flat_check\": true\n}\n```\n-> data\\\\{namespace}\\dimensionfixer\\tweak\\\\{dimension}.json\n\n</details>\n\n所有调整项默认均被禁用。对于 Overworld 别名，睡眠修复默认启用。\n\n## 已知问题\n\n- [Radium]\n  建议使用 Canary 以获得更好的模组兼容性，或手动禁用 \"mixin.ai.poi.fast_portals\"。\n- [YUNG's Better End Island]\n  在别名维度上末影龙战斗不会开始 (<= [MC 1.21.11])\n\n目前没有报告新的兼容性问题或错误。请在 [GitHub](https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/issues) 上报错以便修复。\n\n## 支持版本\n\n🟩 26.1-26.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1 / 🟪 1.16.5 / 🟪 1.12.2\n\n🟩 受支持  \n🟥 已停止支持  \n🟨 进行中  \n🟪 考虑中  \n\n## 重要提示\n\n此模组仅修复硬编码的维度行为。它并不连接传送门（请使用 [Dimension Link](https://modrinth.com/project/mgRpdg8r)）。\n\n本模组旨在用于个人游戏调试、服务器定制和模组包制作。欢迎在模组包、视频、直播或其他类似媒体中使用。如果您喜欢这个模组，可以考虑在经济上支持我，我将不胜感激。\n\n<br />\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"See me on GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Available on CurseForge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Watch me on YouTube\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Chat with me on Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/oreno\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Ko-fi\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://saweria.co/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Saweria\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/mgRpdg8r\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionlink/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Link\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/A2PZGios\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/worldportal/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"World Portal\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Miqj0P3U\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Vanilla World\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/cs5vil9i\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-morecatvariants/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/morecatvariants/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"More Cat Variants\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/LI0BrUQA\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-passengersportalfix/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/passengersportalfix/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Passengers Portal Fix\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/2f4ngcAb\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-createportalintegration/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/createportalintegration/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Create Portal Integration\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/8SpfTsnq\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-superflatdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/superflatdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Superflat Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/y4wxFDPW\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-amplifieddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/amplifieddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Amplified Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Fo9Xodfg\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-largebiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/largebiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Large Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Y3EdVfom\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-mushroomfieldsdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/mushroomfieldsdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Mushroom Fields Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/ItO3yfpJ\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-beta173dimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/beta173dimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Beta 1.7.3 Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HkbFed4W\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-desertdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/desertdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Desert Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HW5SOOxi\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-badlandsbiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/badlandsbiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Badlands Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/63pdCQ3Y\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-forestbiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/forestbiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Forest Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/SrhObyPX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-thevoiddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/thevoiddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"The Void Dimension\"></a>\n</p>",
